/build/
/dist/
# In-place extension: `cmake --build ... --target _core` output copied beside the
# package so `pytest` runs against THIS tree instead of an editable install that
# may point at another checkout. The in-tree ATX_VOL_PYTHON build stages it here
# automatically (cmake/stage_core.cmake), together with the vcpkg DLL closure the
# module imports from its own directory.
src/atxvol/*.pyd
src/atxvol/*.dll
